  (text "PROPOSED GPIO MAP (rev 0 proposal - NOT evidence of historical wiring)\nIO36  GEN_V_ADC     ADC1_CH0 input-only\nIO39  GEN_I_ADC     ADC1_CH3 input-only\nIO34  PUMP_I_ADC    ADC1_CH6 input-only\nIO35  PITCH_FB_ADC  ADC1_CH7 input-only (optional)\nIO32  PUMP_V_ADC    ADC1_CH4\nIO19  FLOW_PULSE    interrupt input\nIO27  RPM_PULSE     interrupt input (optional)\nIO25  SERVO_PWM     LEDC PWM -> U4 buffer\nIO26  PUMP_EN       Q1 gate drive (HW pull-down)\nIO21  I2C_SDA       OLED + I2C expansion\nIO22  I2C_SCL\nIO4/13/23/33  EXP_*  uncommitted expansion\nNot used: IO0/2/5/12/15 (strapping), IO6-11 (flash),\nIO1/3 (USB-UART), IO14 (boot-time PWM), IO16/17 (PSRAM\non WROVER variants), IO18, EN.\nAll analog inputs on ADC1 (ADC2 unusable with Wi-Fi)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 190.5 66.04 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "b55d10f2-12d8-5917-8d2d-3e809a7c78da")
  )
  (text "Historical sketch used OLED on IO2/IO0 (strapping pins), servo on IO5 (strapping) and fed a 5 V ACS712 output\ndirectly to IO34. Rev 0 deliberately moves I2C to IO21/22, servo to IO25 and conditions every analog input.\nFirmware local_config pins must be updated to this map after board confirmation."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
